<title>NEW ZEALAND: RUGBY UNION-Mehrtens ruled out of Bledisloe Cup test.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-Mehrtens ruled out of Bledisloe Cup test.</headline>
<dateline>CHRISTCHURCH 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Injury has forced All Black linchpin Andrew Mehrtens out of the New Zealand team for the Bledisloe Cup test against Australia at Christchurch on Saturday.</p>
<p>Mehrtens will be replaced at first five-eighth by Carlos Spencer.</p>
<p>All Black coach John Hart told Reuters Mehrtens had not fully recovered from a hamstring strain suffered in a test against Fiji in June.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
